  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. PHP analyzer (php.py): (1) apiResource now produces UsageContext.http_method='API_RESOURCE' (was 'RESOURCE'); (2) route-symbol expansion branches on RESOURCE vs API_RESOURCE — API_RESOURCE drops {create, edit}; (3) new helper _laravel_resource_actions_for walks the parent member_call_expression chain to detect .except()/.only() modifiers; (4) _laravel_collect_string_args + _laravel_extract_strings handle both variadic ('a','b') and array (['a','b']) syntaxes. 8 new tests cover apiResource 5-route count, resource+except (variadic + array), only intersection, apiResource+except composition, only-then-except composition, variable-arg fallback to default, and unrelated modifier (->name) does not filter. 100% coverage."  # a79d
